		width: 1rpx;
		height: 60rpx;
		background-color: #f0f1f4;
	}

	.stat-num {
		font-size: 40rpx;
		color: #1f2329;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.color-pending {
		color: #ff8f1f;
	}

